class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Fair launch</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Hyper deflation</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Anti-monopoly rank</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Hold to mine</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Circuit breaker</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">100% decentralized</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Fair launch</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Hyper deflation</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Anti-monopoly rank</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Hold to mine</span></span><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"mq__t\"><i data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Circuit breaker</span></span></div></div></div></section><section data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"blk\"><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\" data-perch=\"power\">Capabilities</p><div data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"card cap\"><div data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"cap__head\"><div data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><h2 data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Core capabilities</h2><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Radar-powered asset issuance</p></div><div class=\"radar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><i class=\"rs\" data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><i class=\"rb b1\" data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><i class=\"rb b2\" data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i><i class=\"rb b3\" data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"></i></div></div><ul data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"cap__list\"><li data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"hot\" style=\"--i: 0;\"><b data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Issue</b><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Launch on-chain assets in one click</span></li><li data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"--i: 1;\"><b data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Community</b><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Radar DAO community launch</span></li><li data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"--i: 2;\"><b data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Participate</b><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Holdings and community contributions compound</span></li><li data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"--i: 3;\"><b data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Trade</b><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">UXUY powers on-chain trading</span></li><li data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"--i: 4;\"><b data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Liquidity</b><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Ecosystem LP backs quality assets</span></li><li data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"--i: 5;\"><b data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">AI</b><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Spot trends, smart money, and alpha</span></li></ul><div data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"cap__q\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"qm l\">“</span><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">From issuance to users, trading, and ecosystem value</p><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"qm r\">”</span></div></div></section><section data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"blk\"><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\" data-perch=\"faq\">FAQ</p><div data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"faq\"><details data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"faq__item\"><summary data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">What is the “best holding zone”?</span></summary><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Static yield uses jump ranking. Holdings in the best zone earn the highest per-token yield; oversized holdings enter anti-monopoly with lower unit yield.</p></details><details data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"faq__item\"><summary data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">How often are rewards settled?</span></summary><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Daily snapshot. Rewards are not auto-credited — claim them on the Mining page.</p></details><details data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"faq__item\"><summary data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Will mining last forever?</span></summary><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">No. Output steps down every 6 months and stops after 990M NARO are mined.</p></details><details data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"faq__item\"><summary data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Where do trading fees go?</span></summary><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Buy 3% goes to the AI treasury; of sell 3%, 1.5% is burned and 1.5% funds the ecosystem.</p></details><details data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"faq__item\"><summary data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">When does the circuit breaker trigger?</span></summary><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">When the drop exceeds 10%, a dynamic sell tax up to 30% applies — half burned, half to RBS buyback/burn.</p></details><details data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"faq__item\"><summary data-v-7f1efba6=\"\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">Can the invite relationship be changed?</span></summary><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\">No. Once bound, the invite relationship cannot be changed. Double-check the invite code and inviter before confirming.</p></details></div></section><section data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"blk\"><p data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\" data-perch=\"social\">Official community</p><div data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"social\" data-guide=\"social\"><a data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"social__row\" href=\"https://x.com/Naro_Officials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" class=\"social__icon is-black\"><img data-v-7f1efba6=\"\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width='22'%20height='22'%20viewBox='0%200%2022%2022'%20fill='none'%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3e%3cpath%20d='M16.2715%202.75H19.0857L12.944%209.77167L20.1673%2019.25H14.5115L10.084%2013.4567L5.01482%2019.25H2.20065L8.77315%2011.7333L1.83398%202.75H7.63648L11.6423%208.04833L16.2715%202.75ZM15.2815%2017.5725H16.8398L6.78398%204.33583H5.11565L15.2